<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Antibiotic Therapy</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">IV or oral antibiotics for bacterial infections — amoxicillin-clavulanate for odontogenic causes, clindamycin for penicillin-allergic patients. Culture-guided therapy for complex infections. <a href="jaw-infection-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline">Jaw infection treatment</a> covers this in detail.</p></li>
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Salivary Gland Management</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Warm compresses, gland massage, sialogogues (citrus to stimulate saliva), and hydration for salivary gland swelling. Small salivary stones may pass spontaneously with conservative management.</p></li>
