<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Tooth Extraction or Root Canal</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Dental-origin jawline swelling requires definitive source treatment — root canal for restorable teeth, extraction for non-restorable teeth.</p></li>
